// CHECK: bit_counts.pia:36:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: bit_counts.pia:41:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: bit_counts.pia:46:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
